// # MCP Crash Fold
//
// Logline: Front door for the crash-to-diagnosis fold: one crashed process in, one TSV report out.
//
// Setup: Seven units. Pure units carry no caps. Capped IO stays in run and
//        fault. The tool is self-contained: no imports outside fold/ but std.
//
// Beats:
//   1. fold_exit.oo is the pure exit classifier.
//   2. fold_stderr.oo is the pure tail and escape formatter.
//   3. fold_probe.oo is the pure next-probe decision table.
//   4. fold_fault.oo locates file:line:col under FsReadCap.
//   5. fold_run.oo spawns argv and captures under ProcessCap.
//   6. fold_emit.oo validates and prints the OK plus RPT block.
//   7. fold_tool.oo wires the crash_report tool to tools/call.

import "fold_exit.oo";
import "fold_stderr.oo";
import "fold_probe.oo";
import "fold_fault.oo";
import "fold_run.oo";
import "fold_emit.oo";
import "fold_tool.oo";
